{
 "about": "Customizations the round 29 cases did not send. A set customization whose entry replaces only the set's own fields, then deleted without recursive: round 29 deleted entries that carried a replaced rule. A PIP customization whose list holds a string beside a valid entry, and one whose only entry names a PIP and nothing else. The HEADER PIP reads X-Parity-R30-Cp1 (v); the valid entry points it at X-Parity-R30-Cp2 (w), so a = n is true before and false once that entry applies.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R30G_",
